  {
   "name": "an extern \"C\" function is a function",
   "text": "pub unsafe extern \"C\" fn uf() {}\n",
   "expectedItem": {
    "kind": "fn",
    "name": "uf",
    "visibility": "pub"
   },
   "defect": "🌳️module-tree/🟦️.ts:parseRustSourceTree skips the `extern` qualifier but not the ABI string literal that follows it, so `extern \"C\" fn` is classified `other` with no name"
  }
